    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yefitsa naEfuraimubaEfuraimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu bakhung'aana halala, nibaambukha nibatsia eZafoni; nibareeba Yefitsa bari Nishiina eshiachila niwaambukha notsia okhuseera abaana baAmoni, ne norakhulanga khutsie ninawe ta? Khulakhusambila munzuyo nomulilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yefitsa nabakalusia mbu Isie nabandu banje khwali nobusoolo obukhongo nabaana baAmoni; ne olwa ndamulanga, shimwayambonia mumukhono kwabwe ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa ndalola mbu shimumboniye ta, ndara butswa obulamu bwanje mumukhono, ninyambukha okhuseera abaana baAmoni, OMWAMI nabahaana mumukhono kwanje; kho nishiina eshichila nimunzitsila leelo okhuseera? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yefitsa nakhung'aasia abaGileadi bosi, nalasana naEfuraimu; abaGileadi nibarootsa Efuraimu, shichila bali nibabaleka, mbu Inywe abaGileadi mweelukha butswa nimurula muEfuraimu, hakari waEfuraimu nahakari waManase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbaGileadi nibeekalila abaEfuraimu tsinyambukho tsieYorodani; mana olwa omwilushi yesi omuEfuraimu yaboolanga mbu Enyambushe; abaGileadi bamureebanga mbu Oli omuEfuraimu noho? Ne naba nakaana mbu Tawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kho bamubiilanga bari Kho boola mbu Shiboletsi; ne naye naboola mbu Siboletsi, okhuba yakhaywa okhuliboola habwene, habwenaho bakhamutiila nibamwirila hanyambukho tsieYorodani; nabo abaEfuraimu abakwa nibeerwa mundaalo etsio bali ebikhumila amakhumi kane nabibili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.6",
